From f193bfb65a922e44294d1c408fc9877fbf27a610 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: heresy <heresy@local>
Date: Wed, 30 Sep 2026 18:12:32 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1017/1198] A top bar of icons that fits at 120%; the takes
 list folds to the right
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

HERESY 1017.
- Open, Save, Load example, Clear, Unload model and Engine become icons;
  their words become their labels and tips (heresy-icons.js). The glyphs are
  Font Awesome 6 Free outlines (CC BY 4.0) taken from the OTF fonts igr.bible
  ships, twelve of them and no font file; the sun is our own, since at 17 px
  Font Awesome's reads as a gear beside the Engine gear.
- The theme button is a palette and the theme's dot; the name is in its tip.
  The day/night button shows a sun, a moon or a half disc.
- The model list says "BF16 · 7.2 GB"; the engine chip keeps one line, its
  detail in its tip.
- The takes list folds to a 40 px strip on the right (» in its header) and
  unfolds from the strip; the form and the take get the room. Kept per browser.
At 1333 px wide (1600 at 120%) the bar holds one line with no scrolling.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 tools/console/app.css         |  20 ++++++++++++++
 tools/console/app.js          |  19 +++++++++++--
 tools/console/heresy-icons.js |  49 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tools/console/index.html      |  18 ++++++++-----
 tools/console/themes.js       |   7 ++---
 tools/public/index.html.gz    | Bin 251344 -> 260246 bytes
 6 files changed, 102 insertions(+), 11 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tools/console/heresy-icons.js

diff --git a/tools/console/app.css b/tools/console/app.css
index e25fa50..5afd492 100644
--- a/tools/console/app.css
+++ b/tools/console/app.css
@@ -1953,3 +1953,23 @@ body[data-tab="write"] .col-grip.left, body[data-tab="post"] .col-grip.left { di
 
 /* ------------------------------------------------ HERESY 1016: form trimming */
 #spectrumPanel:not(.is-drawn) .spec-stage { display: none; }
+
+/* ------------------------------------------------ HERESY 1017: a top bar of icons */
+.hz-icon { width: 17px; height: 17px; display: block; }
+.btn.icon-only, .theme-button, .day-night { padding: 0 9px; min-width: 34px; height: 30px; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 6px; }
+.theme-button .theme-dot { width: 11px; height: 11px; }
+.engine-chip small { display: none; }          /* its words are the chip's tip now */
+.topbar .tabs button { padding: 5px 13px; }
+.lib-fold { margin-left: 2px; }
+.lib-unfold { display: none; }
+.library.is-folded > :not(.lib-unfold) { display: none !important; }
+.library.is-folded .lib-unfold {
+  display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 10px; width: 100%; height: 100%;
+  padding: 14px 0; border: 0; background: none; color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer;
+}
+.library.is-folded .lib-unfold:hover { color: var(--amber); background: var(--hover); }
+.lib-unfold-name { writing-mode: vertical-rl; font: 500 13px/1 var(--sans); letter-spacing: .08em; }
+.lib-unfold-count { font-size: 11px; }
+/* folded: the right column becomes a 40 px strip, its grip goes */
+.workspace.lib-folded { grid-template-columns: var(--col-left, minmax(500px, 760px)) minmax(420px, 1fr) 40px !important; }
+.workspace.lib-folded .col-grip.right { display: none; }
